     1268   define variable vss-include-info7 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1269   on f5 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere
     1270   do:
     1271      v-doc-rec = recid(X_rule-profile).    RUn OpenBR in this-procedure.  REPOSITION br-rule-profile to recid v-doc-rec No-ERROR.   apply 'value-changed' to br-rule-profile.
     1272       apply "VALUE-CHANGED" to br-rule-profile.
